export anchor GraphNetworkStyle:
    number: 409
    screen: DatabaseConsole
    name: Graph network
    idea: The schema is drawn as a node and edge graph, so tables are circles, columns are diamonds, the join is a thick gold edge, result rows are gold nodes sized by their count and history is a chain whose failed link breaks.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #0c0e19, the page
        canvas: #11142a, the graph canvas with a 22px dot grid in #2a3060
        card: #181c38, the inspector cards, history nodes and style sheet
        node: #1f2550, table node fill
        edge: #5a63a8, edges and outlines
        ink: #eceefe, text
        muted: #aab1da, labels, meta and section titles
        table: #a3adff, table node rings
        focusNode: #ff9fd2, the tasks node ring, the Run button, SQL keywords and focus
        result: #ffd27a, the join edge, result nodes, filter rings and string literals
        onResult: #2a1d00, numbers on result nodes
        column: #7fe0d0, column diamonds on #14322f
        ok: #8fe7a8, Ran
        bad: #ff9a9a, the broken link and its error
    type:
        Rounded sans, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito, Varela Round,
        Segoe UI. Base 15px at 1.5. The app name is 19px bold, node labels
        15px bold, section titles 13px caps at 0.1em, the sheet title 26px
        at 800. Columns and SQL use ui-monospace at 13px.
    layout:
        A top bar with a three dot graph mark, Brightwork Data, a
        production-replica pill with a gold ring, and three status pills on
        the right. Below, a wide rounded canvas and a 340px inspector. The
        canvas draws tasks as a large pink ringed circle in the middle with
        six column diamonds around it, id key, project_id, title,
        assignee_id, due_on and status, the last two ringed in dashed gold
        and labelled filter. A thick gold curve labelled join on project_id
        links tasks to projects, and three gold result circles branch from
        projects, Billing migration largest with 2, Mobile app 2.0 and
        Website redesign smaller with 1. Assignee_id curves to members.
        Activity and invoices float with dashed rings as not in the query.
        A shape key sits under the graph. The inspector stacks a Query card
        with the SQL and Run and Show path pills, then a Result nodes card
        listing the three rows with sized gold discs and Ran in 38 ms and
        returned 3 rows. Under everything a History chain links three pill
        nodes, two with a green ringed tick and Ran with duration, the last
        joined by a dashed red link, drawn dashed itself with a crossed
        square and the error. Below 1000px the inspector drops under the
        canvas. On phones the graph scrolls sideways and the chain runs
        down.
    spacing: An 8px unit, a 22px dot grid on the canvas, 16px between cards.
    density: Medium. One large graph and two side cards.
    corners: Very round. 24px canvas, 20px cards, 28px style sheet, full round chips, buttons and history nodes.
    borders: 1 to 2.5px coloured rings. Dashed rings mean not used or failed.
    shadows: None. Rings and the dot grid carry the depth.
    icons:
        Shapes are the icons. Circle for a table, dashed circle for unused,
        diamond for a column, gold disc for a result row, ringed tick for
        Ran and crossed square for Broken, always with a word.
    focus: A 3px pink outline offset 3px.
    tone: Friendly graph words, such as Result nodes, Show path and History chain.
